                    <p><img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/138/portraitideas-2.png" class="type:primaryImage" alt="watercolor and ink drawing of a young woman, messy sketch vibe" /></p>
                <p>I keep finding pieces of myself <br>in the lines <br>that take too long to form a shape <br>in the colors <br>that wait too long to settle or to escape <br>Some marks connect, some break <br>All refuse to be final</p>
<p>-jujube</p>
